      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Valor, Quinn's Demacian eagle, periodically marks enemies with Harrier. Quinn's first basic attack against Harrier targets will deal bonus physical damage.",
      "summary_zh": "华洛，奎因的德玛西亚鹰，会周期性地用侵扰标记敌人。奎因对侵扰目标的第一次普攻将造成额外物理伤害。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1308953:4024765"
      ]
