      "summary_en": "Quinn calls Valor to mark an enemy and hinder its vision before damaging all enemies in the immediate area.",
      "summary_zh": "奎因唤出华洛，来标记一名敌人并遮蔽其视野，然后对目标附近区域内的所有敌人造成伤害。",
