      "summary_en": "Passively grants Quinn Attack Speed and Move Speed after she attacks a Harrier target. Activate to have Valor reveal a large area nearby.",
      "summary_zh": "在奎因攻击了一名侵扰目标后，被动地为奎因提供攻击速度和移动速度。主动激活可以让华洛显形附近的一大片区域。",
